# unlocked at step 72 and the first two by step 144. No board model, no weed
# repair, no market overlay. Every tape buys two quadrants (75 tiles), runs a
# 9-12 animal COW+SHEEP herd on a 12-hand crew, and plants ~190 WHEAT.
